{"id":"3452633bcc4d2389","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-enum.md","title":"阶段枚举的统一可计算性","display":"thm-enum — 阶段枚举的统一可计算性","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-enum","aliases":["20-thm-enum"],"display":"thm-enum — 阶段枚举的统一可计算性","chapter":"1","section":"1.6","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"Theorem 1.6.18","source_pdf_pages":[54],"source_printed_pages":[18],"depends_on":["[[20-df-stages]]","[[20-df-computable]]","[[20-df-characteristic]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-enum"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-enum</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-enum — 阶段枚举的统一可计算性"},{"key":"chapter","html":"1"},{"key":"section","html":"1.6"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 1.6.18"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>54</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>18</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4ef1aee16db6b308\" href=\"?note=4ef1aee16db6b308\" title=\"20-df-stages\">20-df-stages</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"de14d8d6c42250de\" href=\"?note=de14d8d6c42250de\" title=\"20-df-characteristic\">20-df-characteristic</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e,x,s\\in\\omega\">\\(e,x,s\\in\\omega\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4ef1aee16db6b308\" href=\"?note=4ef1aee16db6b308\" title=\"20-df-stages\">20-df-stages</a>。</p>\n<p>上标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{tot}\">\\(\\mathrm{tot}\\)</span> 表示全定义限制：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C_k^{\\mathrm{tot}}=\\{f\\in\\mathcal C_k:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^k\\}\">\\(\\mathcal C_k^{\\mathrm{tot}}=\\{f\\in\\mathcal C_k:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^k\\}\\)</span>；相对族采用同一限制。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"de14d8d6c42250de\" href=\"?note=de14d8d6c42250de\" title=\"20-df-characteristic\">20-df-characteristic</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}enum}\\vdash\n\\exists f\\in\\mathcal C_3^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\ \\forall e,x,s\\\n[f(e,x,s)=\\chi_{W_{e,s}}(x)].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}enum}\\vdash\n\\exists f\\in\\mathcal C_3^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\ \\forall e,x,s\\\n[f(e,x,s)=\\chi_{W_{e,s}}(x)].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>有界模拟程序并检查阶段界，直接产生 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span>。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in W_e\\iff\\exists s\\ [f(e,x,s)=1]\">\\(x\\in W_e\\iff\\exists s\\ [f(e,x,s)=1]\\)</span>。这是统一的三元函数，不是旧稿未声明的“一元 TotalRecursive 中的三元函数”。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 1.6.18；印刷页 18；PDF 第 54 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-stages","status":"resolved","id":"4ef1aee16db6b308","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-stages]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-characteristic","status":"resolved","id":"de14d8d6c42250de","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-characteristic]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-stages","status":"resolved","id":"4ef1aee16db6b308","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-stages]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-computable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-characteristic","status":"resolved","id":"de14d8d6c42250de","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-characteristic]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"e,x,s\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{tot}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C_k^{\\mathrm{tot}}=\\{f\\in\\mathcal C_k:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^k\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}enum}\\vdash\n\\exists f\\in\\mathcal C_3^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\ \\forall e,x,s\\\n[f(e,x,s)=\\chi_{W_{e,s}}(x)].","display":true},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in W_e\\iff\\exists s\\ [f(e,x,s)=1]","display":false}],"bytes":1291,"backlinks":[{"id":"005203b6707a19f4","anchor":"ref-57","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-thm-enum]] — 章 1；直接提供者 2 个。"},{"id":"f4368dd1e05cad1f","anchor":"ref-57","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-thm-enum]]"}],"outgoing":["4ef1aee16db6b308","e343870c773cb68e","de14d8d6c42250de"]}